                                        "entry_id": "c1f0de44-8f84-3748-a380-bb2ebe6edbf7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "位於中國的河，原指廣州到入海口的一段河道，後來逐漸成為西江、北江、東江和珠江三角洲諸河的總稱。其幹流有流經雲南、貴州、廣西、廣東四省及香港、澳門特別行政區的西江，和幾乎全部在廣東境內的北江和東江水系。"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ec6ada03-bce8-41be-8643-a08e731b9ea8",
                        "source_entry_id": "665ea2a0-ce49-3cbe-99f0-4a73f4e80bf5",
                        "source_sense_id": "5eccb23d-ea1c-39fc-8a40-928bc6995826",
                        "source_sense_description": "Ästuar in Südchina",
                        "target_lang_word": "Pearl River",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Pearl River",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8912c694-67a5-36d1-815f-101ea836891a",
                                        "entry_id": "1400c8a2-1ab7-3c9b-abd9-482048aec906",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A major river in southern China."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fdd3923a-2960-44a7-ba5d-c4f9bb2c7ce4",
                                                "sense_id": "8912c694-67a5-36d1-815f-101ea836891a",
                                                "text": "Pirates have of late become so bold and murderous in their attacks upon the small sailing craft found in the delta of the Pearl river, and the islands interjacent, as to arouse the Chinese government to take strong measures to suppress and disperse them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b0ef6fc-36b5-4840-98e4-46ff7d262f7c",
                                                "sense_id": "8912c694-67a5-36d1-815f-101ea836891a",
                                                "text": "The task of directing thousands of pushcarts and tiny handicraft shops and millions of tiny farms and of controlling the flow of crucial supplies created headaches for officials everywhere and the Pearl River Delta area was justly famous for the flowering of tiny enterprises."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de59cc10-a746-4268-8bdf-7aaf9c441e2b",
                                                "sense_id": "8912c694-67a5-36d1-815f-101ea836891a",
                                                "text": "A Chinese-language broadcast from Moscow said the Tienanmen crowds were indeed against Mao but the burning of vehicles and building was started by the Maoists to provide themselves with excuses for stepped-up suppression.\nWe don’t know whether this was the case, but we have learned that some 50,000 Peiping students have been sent to rural and frontier areas since the incident, that corpses have been floating down the Pearl River from Canton, and that the Maoists have been crying out savagely."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c68f29cd-14d3-4d02-96f3-1f094cda313c",
                                                "sense_id": "8912c694-67a5-36d1-815f-101ea836891a",
                                                "text": "Debt-laden real estate developer China Evergrande (3333.HK) has resumed construction of 63 projects in the southern Pearl River delta, a regional subsidiary said on Friday."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
